 ## Background
-DWTNeRF was introduced in 2025 by [S1, unofficial]. It addresses the limitations of NeRF in few-shot scenarios, where dense training views are unavailable. It builds on Instant-NGP's fast-converging hash encoding and CombiNeRF's regularization techniques [S1, unofficial].
+DWTNeRF is a unified framework for few-shot Neural Radiance Fields based on Instant-NGP's fast-training hash encoding [S1, unofficial]. It addresses the limitations of NeRF in few-shot scenarios, where dense training views are unavailable [S1, unofficial]. It builds on CombiNeRF's regularization techniques [S1, unofficial].
 
